# LF everywhere, including on Windows checkouts.
#
# Without this the Windows CI runner checks out with CRLF (git's default
# there), and gofmt reports every single file in the repo as unformatted —
# which is what happened the first time windows-latest was added. It also
# stops CRLF entering the repo from a Windows contributor, where it would
# show up as a whole-file diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touched by line-ending conversion.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
